41506.144900","attachments":[{"fallback":"ZDNet Japan: AWS、複数アプリケーションでのデータ利用を可能にする「S3 Object Lambda」を発表","id":1,"title":"AWS、複数アプリケーションでのデータ利用を可能にする「S3 Object Lambda」を発表","title_link":"https://japan.zdnet.com/article/35168063/","text":"AWSが複数のアプリケーションで同じデータセットを使用できるようにする新機能「S3 Object Lambda」を発表した。","thumb_url":"https://japan.zdnet.com/storage/2021/03/19/f98ba34c39ba6a5c3c6ece43b3f62ed0/awsistock-925557862a_1280x960.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1616117820,"service_name":"ZDNet Japan","service_icon":"https://japan.zdnet.com/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":1280,"thumb_height":960,"from_url":"https://japan.zdnet.com/article/35168063/","original_url":"https://japan.zdnet.com/article/35168063/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sEZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d3aa752-5ed3-4ec6-8da4-0870bdcd84d4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"それなりの割合をサーバレスでアプリケーションを組み上げるみたいな事になった場合、実装がappリポジトリとIaCリポジトリで分散しまくるのきついイメージがしてきた","ts":"1616240897.139300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1616240917.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d30u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fb914b5-d7e0-4770-a9ed-5a063de3228d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、すごいアプリケーション寄りの実装ってLambdaでやるべきじゃなかったりするのかなぁ","ts":"1616240810.138100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1GflO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3b8d5c4-7b7c-4e4c-b88a-430d6e0d29d0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なるほど、ありがとうございます","ts":"1616240793.137700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=gLs8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40901e17-3699-4573-a2f4-8fe36517b4e5","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"lambdaというリソースをIaCで構成するならそれはIaCとして一緒のリポジトリにします。\nCD頑張って仕組み作れるなら分けててもいいかもしれませんが。\nまぁその仕組みはそうそう変わるものでは無いでしょうし最初だけ頑張ればよいと言われればそう。","ts":"1616240752.137400","thread_ts":"1616240752.137400","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D0+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2744e71c-9eff-4723-bc4d-450bc55411db","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"例えば現職でアプリケーションから叩くAPIがLambdaに置かれてて、それは単体の小さなリポジトリになってるんですが","ts":"1616240499.133500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iJl/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24568223-f826-4c43-9de9-ff2f7e60dd28","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ひとまず今回はインフラ側で進めるでよさそうで、その上でアプリケーションと密なものになったらどうします？","ts":"1616240447.132500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8BbA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6127b86f-e388-4523-8e23-9fe0a43d1aab","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"なんとなくパイプラインみたいな感覚がある","ts":"1616240444.132400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f0hmw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c08aca7-e869-4c7a-ac3a-8b5dad99e60c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Lambdaはインフラでいいと思います、個人的には","ts":"1616240393.131100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ber9/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5d76e4a-fecc-48e1-a33c-2b830691b70a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"appのAPIをkickするだけだし、そのドメイン管理とかはIaC側だし・・・","ts":"1616240380.130600","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1616240385.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HQXq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3df9745-e5de-4607-b14c-763992d5473f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Lambda、アプリケーション自体のロジックに直で関わりはしないからインフラ側なのかなぁ","ts":"1616240354.130000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text",